flowchart TB
  RC[Right-click node] --> Head["N object(s)"]
  Head --> Common
  subgraph Common[Always]
    Dup[Duplicate - Ctrl+D]
    Front[Bring to front]
    Back[Send to back]
    Lock[Lock - Ctrl+L]
    Hide[Hide - Ctrl+H]
    Del[Delete]
  end
  Head --> Group[Group - Ctrl+G]
  Head --> Ungroup[Ungroup - Ctrl+Shift+G]
  Group -.-> Need2[Needs 2+ targets]
  Ungroup -.-> IfGrouped[If any target grouped]
  Head --> Img[Crop image / Open file]
  Head --> Pdf[Explode PDF into pages]
  Head --> Tags[Tags swatches]
  Head --> Wire[Wire: arrows / Faint / Edit label]
